  D('attributable', {
    etymology:{origin:'attributable 由 attribute 加 -able 构成；attribute 作“归因于”时来自拉丁语 attribuere「分配、赋予」，由 ad- 与 tribuere「分派」组成。',prefix:{text:'ad-（同化为 at-）',gloss:'给予、朝向'},root:{text:'tribuere',gloss:'分派、赋予'},suffix:{text:'-able',gloss:'能够……的、可被……的'},history:[],formationLogic:null,mnemonic:null,note:'常见结构 be attributable to，表示可将结果归因于某原因；也可表示作品应归功于某人。',source:'Etymonline — attribute'},
    contexts:[{senseId:'attributable.s1',domain:'环境研究 · 因果分析',en:'The decline in river oxygen was attributable to the unusually warm summer and fertilizer runoff, according to measurements collected both upstream and downstream.',zh:'根据在上下游收集的测量数据，河流含氧量下降可归因于异常炎热的夏季和化肥径流。',structure:'The decline in river oxygen / was attributable to the unusually warm summer and fertilizer runoff / according to measurements / collected both upstream and downstream.',grammar:'be attributable to 表示可归因于；according to 引出依据；collected 过去分词修饰 measurements。',rationale:'夏季高温与化肥径流被明确提出为结果原因，符合 attributable 的因果义。',sourceType:'authored'}],
    mistakes:[m('The crop loss was attributable to the new irrigation system, although the system was installed only after the crop had already failed.','The crop loss was not attributable to the new irrigation system, which was installed only after the crop had already failed.','原因必须在结果发生前具备因果可能；事后才安装的系统不能导致先前的作物损失。')],
    quiz:[q('attributable',1,1,'A change in sales is attributable to the new pricing policy. The change?','can be explained as resulting from that policy','is the name of the policy’s author','is impossible to measure','be attributable to 表示可归因于某原因。'),q('attributable',2,2,'A painting is attributable to a particular artist when?','the work can properly be credited to that artist','the artist paid the gallery rent','the painting was found near the artist','attributable 也可表示作品可归属、应归功于某位作者。'),q('attributable',3,1,'Choose the standard phrase.','The improvement was attributable to careful testing.','The improvement was attributable with careful testing.','The improvement was attributable from careful testing.','固定结构为 attributable to + 原因。'),q('attributable',4,1,'If a report says the delay is not attributable to weather, it means weather?','is not identified as the cause of the delay','is the only proven cause','wrote the report','否定结构表示不能把延误归因于天气。')]}
  );

