    contexts:[{senseId:'attribution.s2',domain:'艺术史 · 作品归属',en:'The catalogue lists the portrait as a tentative attribution to Elena Rossi, since the signature is missing and the pigment analysis has not yet produced a definitive result.',zh:'图录将这幅肖像暂定归于埃莱娜·罗西，因为画上没有签名，颜料分析也尚未得出确定结论。',structure:'The catalogue / lists the portrait as a tentative attribution to Elena Rossi / since the signature is missing / and the pigment analysis has not yet produced a definitive result.',grammar:'list A as B；attribution to + 作者；since 引导原因从句；yet 与现在完成时搭配。',rationale:'对作品作者身份的暂定判断对应 attribution 的作品归属义；tentative 表明尚无定论。',sourceType:'authored'}],
