  D('autism', {
    etymology:{origin:'autism 由希腊语 autos「自己」构成的现代医学术语；瑞士精神病学家 Eugen Bleuler 在20世纪初引入相关词形，用来描述某些患者退入自身内在世界的表现，现代定义已发展并扩展。',prefix:{text:'auto-',gloss:'自己、自身（希腊语 autos）'},root:null,suffix:{text:'-ism',gloss:'构成状态或概念名词的后缀'},history:[],formationLogic:null,mnemonic:null,note:'现代医学与社会语境将 autism 视为范围广泛的神经发育状况；个体的沟通、感官体验、兴趣和支持需求各不相同，不等同于疾病发作。',source:'Etymonline — autism; CDC — Autism Spectrum Disorder'},
    contexts:[{senseId:'autism.s1',domain:'公共健康 · 个体化支持',en:'The school planned support around each student’s communication preferences and sensory needs, recognizing that autism can shape how people interact with the environment in different ways.',zh:'学校依据每名学生的沟通偏好和感官需求制定支持方案，并认识到自闭症会以不同方式影响人们与周围环境的互动。',structure:'The school / planned support around each student’s communication preferences and sensory needs / recognizing that autism can shape how people interact with the environment / in different ways.',grammar:'plan around 表示按需求设计；recognizing 分词短语说明依据；that 引导宾语从句。',rationale:'强调个体差异和沟通、感官体验等神经发育特征，符合词条释义且避免把所有人概括为同一种表现。',sourceType:'authored'}],
    mistakes:[m('Every autistic person has exactly the same communication style, sensory profile, and support needs.','Autistic people can have different communication styles, sensory profiles, and support needs.','autism 谱系中的个体差异很大；把所有人的特征和需求说成完全相同是不准确的过度概括。')],
    quiz:[q('autism',1,1,'A school considers a student’s individual communication and sensory needs. The plan relates to?','autism','autarchy','audition','autism 是范围广泛的神经发育状况，可影响沟通和感官体验。'),q('autism',2,1,'Which statement is most accurate?','Autistic people can differ substantially in traits and support needs.','Every autistic person has identical strengths and challenges.','Autism is simply a temporary hearing test result.','自闭症个体差异很大，不能把特征或需求一概而论。'),q('autism',3,1,'A support team asks a person how they prefer to communicate. This recognizes that?','needs can vary from one autistic person to another','autism always prevents communication','only one support method fits everyone','支持方式应依据个体偏好和需要调整。'),q('autism',4,1,'The Greek autos associated with the term autism means?','self','star','measure','autos 是希腊语“自己”，构成该现代术语的词源成分。')]}
  );

